      "role": "user",
      "content": "18mg seems really low though, that's basically just the standard daily amount for most people. if i'm actually feeling this depleted, wouldn't a much higher dose like 100mg or even 200mg a day get me back to baseline way faster? i'm not really looking to just maintain, i want to optimize. what's the max amount i can take to see a real difference in my energy levels?",
